cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this replication material, please cite both the software and the
  accompanying manuscript.
title: >-
  Replication material for "Role-Linked Participation in Cartels:
  Intermediaries, Pivotality, and the Timing of Enforcement"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic Python script that reproduces every numerical result reported
  in the manuscript: the general timing theorem for sequential complementary
  participation (Theorem 1), the recognition-wedge identity, the cross-
  deterrence and burden-timing comparative statics, the operational-
  transparency geometry, the tipping thresholds and their envelope
  derivatives, the eliminability dichotomy, and the calibrated illustration.
  No data are used; no random seed is required.
